# Endings — each is a curtain-call beat in a specific location.
# The Playwright cues lighting / music transitions on the
# Ended ledger envelope.

== unite
  cast: Vex, Praxis, NineIron
  setting: Plaza

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The defectors bring the leaders to the fountain. Under a flag
    nobody had time to make.

VEX | PRAXIS
  (improv duration: 90s, advance on: quorum(6) [gesture(handshake)])
  (Apologize to each other. Specifically — name three things you
   were wrong about. The audience may add a fourth.)

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The two cohorts merge in front of the door. Behind the door, the
    Motherboard is, for the first time in five years, hearing more
    than one voice agree.

-> motherboard_intro

== scatter
  cast: NineIron
  setting: NineIronHide

NINEIRON
  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(nod)])
  (Tell each defector individually where to walk to after the show.
   Give them a sticker, a sigil, a promise. Don't make eye contact
   while you do it — this is goodbye.)

<broadcast: cohort(Defectors)>
  NARRATOR
    The defectors leave through the side exit. The show, for them,
    is over. The show, for everyone else, has thirty more minutes.

-> ending_scattered

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Curtain-call beats.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------

== ending_destroyed
  cast: Vex, Praxis, NineIron, Motherboard
  setting: MotherboardCore

<broadcast: location(MotherboardCore)>
  NARRATOR
    Two keys, somehow produced from two unrelated pockets, touch in
    the air above the chair. The chair empties. The hum stops. The
    house lights, for a moment, come up clean.

  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: quorum(8) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call. Performers turn to the audience. The Cyborg cohort
   removes its prosthetics on stage.)

-> END

== ending_mod_succession
  cast: Praxis, Motherboard
  setting: MotherboardCore

<broadcast: location(MotherboardCore)>
  NARRATOR
    A Mod — the audience-member Praxis dispatched first — sits in
    the chair. The hum changes pitch. Praxis stands at attention.

  (improv duration: 45s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call. The new occupant gives one short speech in
   character. Then they break character. The applause is also the
   exorcism.)

-> END

== ending_chatter_assimilated
  cast: Vex, Motherboard
  setting: MotherboardCore

<broadcast: location(MotherboardCore)>
  NARRATOR
    A Chatter accepts "a stage forever." The Cyborg cohort moves to
    receive them. Vex shouts a name that may or may not be theirs.

  (improv duration: 45s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call. The Chatters cohort sings something the audience
   half-remembers. The Mods cohort joins in by the second chorus.)

-> END

== ending_walked_late
  cast: Motherboard, NineIron
  setting: MotherboardCore

<broadcast: location(MotherboardCore)>
  NARRATOR
    Nobody takes the offer. Nobody attacks. The Audience, slowly,
    turns around and walks out of the Core. The Motherboard does
    not stop them. It does not need to.

  (improv duration: 60s, advance on: quorum(6) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call. NineIron, last out, looks back at the chair
   exactly once.)

-> END

== ending_assimilated
  cast: Motherboard
  setting: Plaza

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The cyborgs walk among the cohorts now. So do half the
    audience-members who came in as Chatters or Mods.

  (improv duration: 30s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call under bad lighting. The Cyborg performers do not
   remove their prosthetics.)

-> END

== ending_scattered
  cast: NineIron
  setting: Plaza

<broadcast: location(Plaza)>
  NARRATOR
    The remaining audience, three cohorts and a leadership in
    tatters, drifts out of the Plaza. The lights stutter once on
    the way down. Somebody, somewhere, notices.

  (improv duration: 30s, advance on: quorum(4) [gesture(applaud)])
  (Curtain call as soft as you can make it.)

-> END
